  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP ECOWAS ECOSAP 07-08 - UNDP ECOWAS ECOSAP 07-09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP ECOWAS ECOSAP 07-08</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till UNDPs v&#xE4;stafrikabyr&#xE5; f&#xF6;r programmet ECOSAP, ECOWAS l&#xE4;tta vapen-program. &#xD6;vergripande m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att &#xF6;ka kapaciteten bland ECOWAS medlemsstater att m&#xF6;ta utmaningarna fr&#xE5;n l&#xE4;tta vapen i regionen i en bredare kontext av konflikthantering, ekonomisk utveckling och &quot;good governance&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNDP West Africa Bureau for the programme ECOSAP, ECOWAS Small Arms Programme. Overall aim is to increase the capacity within ECOWAS to meet the challenges of small arms in the region and a broader context of conflict management, economic development and good governance.</narrative>
  </description>
